        "summary": "Sandglass Dy9 cluster showing frequency-dependent out-of-phase ac susceptibility (slow magnetic relaxation) but no χ″ maxima, so Arrhenius and Bartolomé Ea/τ0 fits could not be obtained. χMT at 300 K is 127.71 cm3 K mol−1, falling to 66.97 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K; M = 50.29 μB at 70 kOe and 2.0 K, far from saturation. Applied 1000 Oe dc field does not suppress QTM. Magellan electrostatic axes of the nine DyIII ions are nonparallel.",
